    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "incubation? i don't know man. it doesn't feel like i'm growing, it feels like i'm rotting. it’s not even a phase. i can see the ceiling. i’m just a shell of what i used to be and the more i try, the more i just prove how much i've lost. it's getting harder to even look at my gear.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
