    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"stepping away\" isn't enough. if i just stop, i'm still here, still existing as this failure. i'd rather stop now while i'm still \"something\" than live to see myself become a total joke. wouldn't it be better to just leave it all behind completely while the memory of my work is still good?",
